    <reapack name="Foldback.lua" type="script" desc="Foldback - headphone (cue) mixes for REAPER">
      <metadata>
        <description>Per-performer headphone mixes in REAPER. A small panel lets you set each performer's level and pan for every track, preview a mix on your speakers (Listen), talk to the performers (talkback), and protect their ears with a limiter. Needs the ReaImGui extension.</description>
      </metadata>
